                <p>Meets once a month on the second Thursday at the Horseless Carriage in Van Nuys. We meet in a private room and have our dinner around 5:30. Discussion starts at 6:30. During the year we select a general topic for each month. At the meeting we take turns giving our opinion, avoiding the subject of politics, trying to find common ground rather engage in a debate.</p>
