      StaRGazing
    </h1>
    <p class="text-2xl text-blue-200 font-medium mb-8">GLAAM’s Regional Gathering</p>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300 space-y-4 mb-10">
      <p>
        Every year over Presidents’ Day weekend, we conduct a weekend-long convention for GLAAM members and our friends from neighboring Mensa chapters. Long tradition refers to these events as “Regional Gatherings” or “RGs”.
      </p>
      <p>
        We take over a local hotel, rent out meeting rooms for speakers, games, and hospitality, and set up a multi-track schedule of fun activities to keep you amused and stimulated all weekend long!
      </p>
    </div>
    
